|**MITRE ATT&CK**|**Tactics:** High-level adversary operational goals (e.g., Initial Access, Persistence, Privilege Escalation).<br>**Techniques:** Methods used to achieve tactical goals (e.g., Phishing, Credential Dumping).<br>**Procedures:** Specific adversary execution implementations.|Maps live threat telemetry directly to known adversary behaviors to enhance detection coverage and guide threat hunting.|
